### Inscription
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Test Etudiant",
  "email": "test@exemple.com",
  "motDePasse": "motdepasse123"
}

### Connexion
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@exemple.com",
  "motDePasse": "motdepasse123"
}